Short:        File requester in assembler
Uploader:     BIRJT cc newcastle edu au
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

Type: util/misc

Uploader: BIRJT@cc.newcastle.edu.au

Author: Andri Wichmann

A new file requester which is small, fast and has some new
features.  It has a flexible filter option, optional DOS-
gadgets (delete, rename and makedir), displays the size of
a program, is fast, can display all connected devices, etc.
Version 2.0, includes source in assembly language.

